nodes.body:
Thanks for confirming readiness! The actual integrated source passed all 31 targeted tests on SM100 with no skips. I added current develop with a normal merge commit (`527534fc816fc9dd2a9dd9642feba508ef759d35`) so the current repository security checks can run. The new Style and Security runs are waiting for fork-workflow approval; I am keeping the PR open until those gates complete.

@cudnn-ci-bot run python/gemm/frost

<!-- external-watch-security-integration:1265:527534fc816fc9dd2a9dd9642feba508ef759d35 -->

